{"id":"orbital-f335c5","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-4337529b-a69c-4450-b54e-d217b4f8fa3c","text":"**Summary** — Added `InlineStack` layout component: `inline_stack.rb` (Ruby component), `inline-stack.css` (stylesheet), `_inline_stack.html.orb` (demo partial), gallery entry in `index.html.orb`, and RSpec tests in `inline_stack_spec.rb`.\n\n**Rationale** — Mirrors the existing `Stack` component pattern exactly (same attribute DSL, `data-*` selectors, `@layer components` CSS, gap/align/justify/padding props) but with `flex-direction: row`. The `wrap` prop uses a presence-based design: bare `wrap` for `flex-wrap: wrap`, `wrap=\"reverse\"` for `flex-wrap: wrap-reverse`, omitted for no wrapping.\n\n**Decisions made** — Biome auto-formatted `stack.css` alongside `inline-stack.css` (pre-existing formatting mismatch with the multi-line rule style Biome enforces). Included as part of this change rather than a separate commit.\n\n**Status** — All lint (RuboCop, Biome, TypeScript), style, and test suites pass. Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-07-27T14:38:12.595434Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.220 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
