{"id":"orbital-4005a9","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-9e29795c-a1ac-47d9-b685-e1626fd73f70","text":"**Summary** — Added `fullwidth` boolean prop to `Button`. Three files changed: `button.rb` (attribute + data attribute), `button.css` (one CSS rule), `_button.html.orb` (demo example + API reference row).\n\n**Rationale** — Follows Button's existing `data-*` attribute pattern (consistent with `data-disabled`, `data-variant`, `data-size`). Uses `@fullwidth || nil` guard so the attribute is only emitted when `true`.\n\n**Decisions made** — None beyond the spec.\n\n**Status** — All lint, style, and tests pass. Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-07-27T17:49:29.555816Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.220 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
