{"id":"orbital-45d373","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-9d868ddd-bcc9-43b3-aab5-0e8378344ddb","text":"**Summary** — Added `Grid` layout component: `grid.rb` (Ruby component), `grid.css` (stylesheet with column/gap/span rules), `_grid.html.orb` (demo partial), gallery entry, controller/search whitelist entries, and RSpec tests.\n\n**Rationale** — Grid uses `{{content}}` passthrough like Stack and InlineStack. Column spanning is handled via a `data-grid-span` attribute on child elements, targeted by `.Orbital-Grid \u003e [data-grid-span=\"N\"]` CSS selectors. No sub-component needed — avoids the ORB slot/namespace resolution complexity entirely.\n\n**Decisions made** — Iterated through several approaches for span control during review: slot-based `Grid:Cell`, namespace `Grid::Cell`, standalone `GridCell`, and finally settled on pure `data-grid-span` attribute. The attribute approach is the simplest — no extra component, no extra DOM node, just CSS.\n\n**Status** — All lint, style, and tests pass (20 examples, 0 failures). Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-07-27T19:35:30.238496Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.220 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
