{"id":"orbital-2b7ca2","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-c2570571-a282-4494-8e8d-dadbf086bfe4","text":"## Summary\n\n- **Generator script** (`orbital/bin/generate-icons`): Bun script that reads Lucide SVGs from `lucide-static` npm package, extracts FA brands methods from the existing `icons.rb`, and writes the combined output. Runnable via `bun run generate:icons`.\n- **`orbital/lib/orbital/icons.rb`**: Regenerated with 2,007 Lucide icons + 549 FA brands icons = 2,556 methods (down from 2,806). `VARIANTS` constant removed; `render(name)` does Lucide-first lookup with automatic FA brands fallback.\n- **`Orbital::Icon` component**: `variant` attribute removed. API is now just `name` + `size`.\n- **92 icon names remapped** across 3 library components and ~20 demo app templates/pages. All `variant` references removed from templates.\n- **Icon documentation page** rewritten for Lucide — updated examples, API reference, prose.\n\n## Rationale\n\nFollowed the spec. Lucide-first lookup with FA brands fallback keeps the API minimal — callers never need to know which set an icon comes from.\n\n## Decisions made\n\n- `lucide-static` v1.27.0 installed (2,007 icons available)\n- SVGs collapsed to single-line strings in heredocs (matches existing FA format)\n- Lucide `class=\"lucide lucide-\u003cname\u003e\"` attribute preserved from source SVGs for debugging/targeting\n\n## Status\n\nBuild passes, user top-hatted — ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-07-29T09:41:03.563616Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.220 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
