{"id":"orbital-2b9b13","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Dialog.turbo_frame_response raises NoMethodError","description":"`Orbital::Dialog.turbo_frame_response` in `app/components/orbital/dialog.rb` calls `Turbo::StreamsHelper.turbo_stream`, but `turbo_stream` is an instance method, so it raises:\n\n```\nNoMethodError: undefined method 'turbo_stream' for module Turbo::StreamsHelper\n```\n\nIt also needs `turbo-rails`, which the gemspec doesn't declare, so apps without that gem would get a `NameError` instead.\n\nNothing in this repo calls the method. Found during orbital-3e0b0c, and left out of that change because it's a behaviour fix.\n\n**To decide:** fix it and declare or document the Turbo requirement, or remove the method.","status":"BACKLOG","sort_order":"aM","dependencies":[{"source_id":"orbital-2b9b13","target_id":"orbital-3e0b0c","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["bug"]},"created_at":"2026-11-05T23:28:44.868715Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"orbital-3e0b0c","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-20af4579-9af0-4cdf-b113-9234405cf4a2","text":"**Summary:** The gem is at the root and the docs app is at `test/dummy`, with one bundle and one JS package. The dummy no longer has Active Record, Active Job, Action Cable, Action Mailer or Active Storage. Kamal and the Rails credentials are gone, and a root `Dockerfile` replaces them. Packaging, gemspec, Makefile, tests, lint and license notices now meet the public gem standard.\n\n**Rationale:** Consumers get a package with only `app/`, `lib/`, `LICENSE` and `README.md`, and every tool now has one config at the root.\n\n**Decisions not in the original spec:** see the spec's Decisions section: `parcel build --no-cache`, removing the bundling gems, explicit `protect_from_forgery`, and a standalone test app.\n\n**Verification:**\n- `make test`, `make test-rubies` (Ruby 3.4.12 and 4.0.9) and `make build` pass. The package has 74 files.\n- The tests pass and all 30 component doc partials render on Rails 7.1.6 with Ruby 3.4.12.\n- All 38 paths return 200 under `bin/dev` and in the Docker image. HTML matches the pre-move baseline, apart from one deliberate search description.\n- The gem's JS is byte-identical to the baseline. The gem's CSS lost 21 stray utility selectors that no component uses, and gained none.\n\n**Known limits:**\n- `changelog_uri` returns 404 until this is merged and pushed.\n- The published Rails key stays in git history. It's retired, and history wasn't rewritten.\n- `marcel` and `prism` are behind their latest majors, capped by their parent gems.\n\n**Status:** ready for review. Changes are staged and not committed."},"created_at":"2026-11-05T23:35:37.055412Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"orbital-c8c570","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-24591f38-c55b-41d9-aad1-0ef86e514170","text":"orbital-3e0b0c moved most of this list to the latest major or removed it: `puma` 8, `brakeman` 8, `minitest` 6, `typescript` 7 and `postcss-cli` 12. `solid_cable` and `image_processing` are no longer dependencies. Still behind: `marcel` (capped at `~\u003e 1.0`) and `prism` (capped at `~\u003e 1.x`) by their parent gems. This issue can probably close once that change merges."},"created_at":"2026-11-05T23:35:37.078633Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
