{"id":"orbital-4bb5a9","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-d362e7d0-12e0-4329-9534-94643ecc172d","text":"**Summary:** Updated `lucide-static` to 1.70.0 and `caniuse-lite` to 1.0.30001823, and regenerated `lib/orbital/icons.rb` (5 icons added, none removed). The docs samples now use a made-up person, Sam Taylor.\n\n**Decisions:** see the spec: a new name because Alex Rivera already appears beside these samples, `initials=\"ST\"` on the replacements, `email` kept only on the Avatar page, and a reworded Fallback Chain caption.\n\n**Verification:**\n- `make test`, `make test-rubies` and `make build` pass; `lint-js`, `typecheck` and `bun-audit` pass; `bun outdated` is clean.\n- The gem's CSS and JS are byte-identical to the previous build. The package still has 74 files, and the notices are still in `icons.rb`.\n- All 41 docs paths return 200, with no errors in the server log. The rendered pages I searched have no trace of the old name. The Avatar page was not checked by eye.\n\n**Known limit:** the Avatar page no longer shows a Gravatar photo, because no sample address has one.\n\n**Status:** ready for review; not committed."},"created_at":"2026-11-06T09:07:12.110226Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
