{"id":"orbital-cf6aa6","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Add a src prop to Image, mutually exclusive with asset","description":"`Image` only accepts `asset`, so it can't show an image from a URL. Add `src`. An `Image` takes exactly one of `src` and `asset`. Requested by the maintainer.","status":"PLANNED","sort_order":"a0","labels":["improvement"]},"created_at":"2026-11-06T10:06:34.551684Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
