{"id":"orbital-cf6aa6","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-e756f2e1-2b5e-4203-b466-66cae3a33b5b","text":"**Summary:** `Image` accepts `src`, used as given, or `asset`, resolved through `asset_path`. Passing both or neither raises `ArgumentError`, and a blank value counts as not passed. The docs page, README and changelog are updated, and `test/components/orbital_ui/image_test.rb` covers the behaviour.\n\n**Status:** ready for review; not committed."},"created_at":"2026-11-06T10:07:53.639044Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
