{"id":"orbital-c8c570","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-3e8c6949-50a7-44b5-9d39-ea5ae3c4e5c4","text":"Closing. Everything on this list is at its latest major or no longer a dependency, except two gems capped by parents that are already at their latest releases:\n\n- `marcel` 1.2.1 (latest 2.1.0): `activestorage` 8.1.4.1 requires `~\u003e 1.0`.\n- `prism` 1.9.0 (latest 2.1.0): `rubocop-ast` 1.50.0 requires `~\u003e 1.7`, and `minitest` 6.0.6 requires `~\u003e 1.5`.\n\nThey can move once those gems loosen their limits."},"created_at":"2026-11-06T10:11:39.266787Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
