{"id":"orbital-d98747","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Add the Fernhill demo app under demos/fernhill","description":"Keep Fernhill, the fictional finance app built to prove the `-j bun -c tailwind` setup, in the repo as a demo. It runs against the current code through a path dependency, and shows the components working together in a real app, which `test/dummy` doesn't. Requested by the maintainer.","status":"PLANNED","sort_order":"a0","dependencies":[{"source_id":"orbital-d98747","target_id":"orbital-62f832","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["task"]},"created_at":"2026-11-06T11:16:07.498873Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"orbital-d98747","type":"ARTIFACT","payload":{"artifact_type":"spec","filename":"spec.md","action":"created"},"created_at":"2026-11-06T11:16:27.656826Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"orbital-d98747","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING","sort_order":"a0","assignee":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","dependencies":null,"labels":null},"created_at":"2026-11-06T11:16:27.888644Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"orbital-d98747","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-9e64ea23-55c9-41ae-8929-05543026fc74","text":"**Summary:** Fernhill is in `demos/fernhill`, with `path: \"../..\"`, its own README, `make demo`, and a link from the main README. It's excluded from the published gem and the docs site's Docker image.\n\n**What the root checks do with a second app:**\n- RuboCop and Brakeman cover it, so the demo follows `kuyio-rubocop`, with no overrides, and sets `protect_from_forgery` explicitly.\n- Trivy scans its lockfiles. An advisory in the demo's dependencies fails `make test`, so its lockfiles need keeping current. `trivy.yaml` stays the standard template.\n- Biome and the test task don't reach it.\n\n**Decision not in the spec:** the transfer action validates on the server, because this is public sample code.\n\n**Status:** ready for review; not committed."},"created_at":"2026-11-06T11:24:20.240102Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
