{"id":"orbital-8a7c72","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Add a Form component with model binding","description":"Every field in a form is wired by hand today: `name`, `value`, `label` and `error`. Add `\u003cForm model={@record}\u003e` and a form builder, so `\u003cForm:TextField name=\"email\"/\u003e` fills those in from the model, including validation errors.\n\nPorted from existing MIT-licensed KUY.io code, with the namespace changed and adapted to Orbital's components. It may be consolidated later. Requested by the maintainer.\n\nAlso make `Select` and `CheckBox` work with model binding, and give the Fernhill demo real validation errors in its transfer dialog.","status":"PLANNED","sort_order":"a0","dependencies":[{"source_id":"orbital-8a7c72","target_id":"orbital-d98747","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-11-06T11:41:52.958865Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.318 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
